  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the VRC for time to time my right Oculus controller is losing tracking in the way that: when doing \"open hand\" the game is doing \"piece sign\".\nSo game still think i am keeping my thumb on controller but i am not (and at the same time when this bug occur in VRC, in the oculus desktop dash the hand work perfectly fine so thumb is registering movement.\nIn the SteamVR Controller setting everything work fine so its not a controler defect\nThis bug only happening to my right hand controller and its switch \"on/off\" so its super annoying because my gestures sometimes works perfectly fine and sometimes not",
